  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいポスターに仕上がったな……！！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、こんコピー……\r\n聞いとったとと違うとけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『今宵、あなたの月に逢いに来て』\r\n……そうか、こうなったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なんかあったと？　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、広報担当スタッフの方から、\r\nコピーを変更するかもしれないって連絡を受けていてな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘にインスピレーションを受けたから、\r\n上の方の人にかけ合いたいって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……\r\nそがん話のあったとね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『あなたの月』とナイトプールで出会ってもいいし、\r\nプールで『わたしの月』を見つけなおしてもいい──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここは柔らかな微笑みと、\r\n優しい抱擁が似合う『月』のプール",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんな広告にしたくなった、って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なんだか、こそばゆか……\r\nけど、嬉しかね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、２テイク目の恋鐘の表情\r\n本当によかったと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "広報担当の方は繊細で神秘的って言ってたけど、\r\n俺には優しくて、あたたかなものに見えていたんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほんと？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n故郷のこと考えてたって聞いて、なるほどと思ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサー、実はね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004014110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あん撮影の後、家帰ったら\r\nこがん連絡の来とったと",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401411/2004014110100"
  },
